; One variable: `layout_direction = 3` (RTL) on the Control the menu sits under. A PopupMenu states no
; direction of its own, so it inherits: the check mark and icon sit at the right edge, the text runs
; right to left, and the scroll container's bar side flips (`popup_menu.cpp:857-1064`).

